  WHY THIS MODULE IS A CONTROL ON THE REINSTATED API STRATEGY.

  This module's source is unchanged by the migration: no import was edited, no assertion was altered,
  no rewrite of a mocking framework applies to it, and it holds no site of the static audit
  remediation. Its own POM declares its two test libraries without versions and has no build block and
